<title>USA: MGE deliverable HRS wheat stocks.</title>
<headline>MGE deliverable HRS wheat stocks.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS, MN 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Minneapolis Grain Exchange reported stocks of hard red spring wheat in deliverable position as of Sept 6, in 000 bushels. Stocks in exchange approved elevators deliverable against MGE futures. Deliverable and non-deliverable grades exclude CCC stocks.</p>
<p>						Sept 6   WEEK    YEAR</p>
<p>							   AGO     AGO</p>
<p>						   MINNEAPOLIS AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				 2,077   1,846   2,306</p>
<p>Non-deliverable			     136     208   1,334</p>
<p>CCC stocks				     21	21	34</p>
<p>Total					 2,234   2,075   3,674</p>
<p>						   DULUTH/SUPERIOR</p>
<p>Deliverable				 4,179   3,942  11,459</p>
<p>Non-deliverable			   1,165   1,201   4,645</p>
<p>CCC stocks				    633     633     927</p>
<p>Total					 5,977   5,776  17,301</p>
<p>Note: Minneapolis area includes Minneapolis/St Paul/Red Wing. (Chicago newsdesk 312 983 7278)</p>
